    "current_stage_parents_committed": "前段階commit済み、現在段階内の依存成果と入力版が一致。",
    "eligibility_allowed": "固定MethodCardと計画に基づく全必須hard検査がpass、warningは保持。",
    "plan_allows_na_and_record_committed": "required=false、allow_not_applicable=true、許可規則一致、判定artifact保存済み。",
